@api = http://localhost:5271

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### Leave
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How many days of annual leave do employees get?" }

### Remote work
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Can I work from home, and how many days a week?" }

### Expenses
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the process for claiming travel expenses?" }

### Code of conduct
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What should I do if I witness harassment at work?" }

### Out of scope — should return the "not found" answer
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the capital of France?" }

### Invalid — should return 400
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "" }
